        "TextSection": {
            "TextSectionType": "Definition",
            "Contents": "A rare life-threatening genetic coagulation disorder characterized by an increased risk of blood clot formation in several members of a family due to a thrombomodulin gene mutation. Patients may manifest with venous thromboembolic disease premature myocardial infarction and/or arterial thrombosis."
